  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6158db6e4fba87b43b41b4be4b10ee04, type: 3}
  m_Name: Book_02_Starfish
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MonsterBookEntry
  monster: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 69dea81c810050f40bd352f990990a90, type: 2}
  danger: 3
  background: A variant of an ancient creature with many eyes. Do not make eye contact,
    or you will fall into a nightmare.
  events:
  - icon: {fileID: -1955155378064326011, guid: 0e18d3b06c66d674086dafc863678841, type: 3}
    appearance: '[The ever-present gaze.]'
    solutionLines:
    - It hates being watched. Don't stay on one screen.
    - A, D, A, D... don't let your fingers rest.
    lockedLines:
    - "It hates \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0. Don't \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0 one
      \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0."
    - "\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0... don't let your \u25A0\u25A0 rest."
  - icon: {fileID: 8609290392234125792, guid: 8ab2e0d82c4f0064387b1bf989d3c08f, type: 3}
    appearance: '[Look at me, human!]'
    solutionLines:
    - In the Very Cold, its grip on the glass begins to slip.
    - Normal Oxygen burns it. Let it burn.
    lockedLines:
    - "In the \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0, its \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0 begins to slip."
    - "\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0 burns it. \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0."
  - icon: {fileID: -4846979748559533239, guid: 81d290f8e47c3e047bcdac6b11b5acf9, type: 3}
    appearance: '[Pulsing severed limbs.]'
    solutionLines:
    - Turn up the Heat. Melt the foam before it seals you in.
    - 'Raise the Oxygen.Just let it decay. '
    lockedLines:
    - "Turn \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0. \u25A0\u25A0 the foam before \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0."
    - "\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0. Just let it \u25A0\u25A0."
